sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as Orchestrator
    participant Z as Unzip skill
    participant R as PDF reader
    participant E as Excel writer
    participant F as Upload flow
    participant D as OneDrive
    U->>A: Application ZIP
    A->>Z: Extract ZIP
    Z-->>A: PDF manifest
    loop Each application, sequentially
        A->>R: Read application PDF
        R-->>A: Fields JSON + evidence
        A->>E: JSON + clean template
        E-->>A: Validated XLSX
    end
    loop Each completed workbook
        A->>F: XLSX bytes + batch folder
        F->>D: Create file
        D-->>F: Stored path + ID
        F-->>A: Confirmed upload
    end
    A-->>U: Paths + issues
